# HISTORICAL REJECTED MODEL — NOT RUN BY CI
#
# This file used to mirror the original fixed-cost x4 final compression. The
# decomposition performed in diagnostic PR #10 refuted the magnitude ordering
# required by its first `fast_two_sum(b, a1)` under destructive cancellation.
# Concrete Float64 diagnostics then found non-normalized old outputs.
#
# The accepted x4 source no longer uses this fixed-cost normalization network;
# it uses general TwoSum transforms followed by `MultiFloats.renormalize`.
# Retain this marker so future work does not accidentally restore the rejected
# assumption. See STATUS.md, docs/NUMERICAL_CONTRACT.md, and closed PR #10.
